@startuml Register Flow
skinparam style strictuml

actor Browser
participant "Gateway\n/auth/register" as GW
database Redis
participant Keycloak

Browser -> GW: GET /api/v1/auth/register?return_to=/
activate GW

GW -> GW: sanitizeReturnTo(return_to)
GW -> GW: state = uuid.New()
GW -> Redis: SetState(state, "/")\nTTL = 5 min
Redis --> GW: OK

GW -> GW: Build Keycloak registrations URL\nclient_id, redirect_uri,\nresponse_type=code, scope=openid, state

Browser <-- GW: 302 Redirect → Keycloak /registrations
deactivate GW

Browser -> Keycloak: GET /realms/{realm}/protocol/openid-connect/registrations?...
activate Keycloak
Keycloak --> Browser: Registration page (gordle theme)
Browser -> Keycloak: POST registration data
Keycloak --> Browser: 302 Redirect → /api/v1/auth/callback?code=...&state=...
deactivate Keycloak

@enduml
